  "solution": "**Given**\n\ntan x = 7/5\n\n**Formula used**\n\ntan x = P/B\n\nsin x = P/H\n\ncos x = B/H\n\n**Calculation**\n\ntan x = 7/5 = P/B\n\nH² = P² + B²\n\nH2 = 7² + 5²\n\nH2 = 49 + 25 = 74\n\nh = √74.\n\n(9 sin x - frac{42)/(5)cos x}{15 sin x + 21 cos x}\n\n⇒ (9 × 7/√74 - 42/5 × 5/√74)/(15 × 7/√74 + 21 × 5/√74)\n\n⇒ (21/√74)/(210/√74)\n\n⇒ 21/210\n\n⇒ 0.1\n\n**The value is 0.1**",
